  m_text: "Unlocked: backstory\n\nWhile serving in the army, the player was injured,
    making it dangerous to continue serving, which is why he was finally able to
    retire and go to a remote village with his family. But after becoming king, \u201Cbrain
    738\u201D ordered all former military personnel to be arrested, since they knew
    too much."
