  m_text: "Dear player. It's me, Autogamer (Developer).\r\n\r\nI\u2019m writing to
    you for a reason, that 0, didn\u2019t you find him strange? That he knows too
    much? So... He shouldn't have existed, because of 1 mistake this character appeared
    and stole the power of the game engine.\nUnlike everyone else, after starting
    a new game he does not reset his memory, he remembers everything... Delete the
    game as soon as possible, he can go into other apps and cause chaos... FaaassstttNOOOtfsjdkfhfkjd##..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0161d805a3764c089bef00bfe00793f5, type: 2}
